Thus begins the tale unseen:
Proclaim the text of calling hero with 48, 18.
Proclaim the text of calling hero with 100, 75.
Speak "Still alive".

To hero, taking men as whole number, and hen as whole number, giving whole number:
If the hen is zero, then:
Give back the men.
Otherwise:
Give back calling hero with the hen, the remainder of the men and the hen.
So be it.
